    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "If your app uses the [`playAndRecord`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/playandrecord.md) category, calling this method with the [`AVAudioSession.PortOverride.speaker`](avaudiosession/portoverride/speaker.md) option causes the system to route audio to the built-in speaker and microphone regardless of other settings.",
      "ko": "앱이 [`playAndRecord`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/playandrecord.md) 카테고리를 사용하는 경우, [`AVAudioSession.PortOverride.speaker`](avaudiosession/portoverride/speaker.md) 옵션으로 이 메서드를 호출하면 시스템은 다른 설정에 상관없이 오디오를 내장 스피커와 마이크로 라우팅합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "40a3b532c9015b0df8a00251633c9c9333ab83b79abe2ff0acf944638963d41e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This change remains in effect only until the current route changes or you call this method again with the [`AVAudioSession.PortOverride.none`](avaudiosession/portoverride/none.md) option.",
      "ko": "이 변경은 현재 경로가 바뀌거나 [`AVAudioSession.PortOverride.none`](avaudiosession/portoverride/none.md) 옵션으로 이 메서드를 다시 호출할 때까지만 유지됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "83574ed51db02f4f84ced170742cf61911629a1c4fee116469fe73be0eda859f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "If you’d prefer to permanently enable this behavior, you should instead set the category’s [`defaultToSpeaker`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/defaulttospeaker.md) option.",
      "ko": "이 동작을 영구적으로 사용하려면 카테고리의 [`defaultToSpeaker`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/defaulttospeaker.md) 옵션을 대신 설정해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "dbba4df6ad48e4673294cf2f33495cbf1171482935d17a3864659a28fb4ea4ab",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Setting this option routes to the speaker rather than the receiver if no other accessory such as headphones are in use.",
      "ko": "이 옵션을 설정하면 헤드폰 등의 다른 액세서리가 사용되지 않을 때 수신기 대신 스피커로 라우팅됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "885aa3e6742ae3e7b1af028f06fdb6fcdee204559813a68fb9465123820328d5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: The preferred method for routing audio to the speaker instead of the receiver for speakerphone functionality is through the use of the [`Media Player`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer) framework’s [`MPVolumeView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer/MPVolumeView) class.",
      "ko": "**참고**: 스피커폰 기능에서 오디오를 수신기 대신 스피커로 라우팅하려면 [`Media Player`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer) 프레임워크의 [`MPVolumeView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MediaPlayer/MPVolumeView) 클래스를 사용하는 것이 바람직합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8ca77cf855618f88bcc754b46d4e78b90b68c7c179377207bed102392637a2b1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
